{"scene_id": "s02391", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s02391.fountain", "heading": "INT. BAKERY TASTING ROOM - DAY", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "GABRIEL ROSSETTI-OKEKE", "names": ["GABRIEL ROSSETTI-OKEKE", "GABRIEL"], "gender": "m", "first": 3, "spoke": 7}, {"id": 1, "name": "THEO ANDRZEJEWSKI", "names": ["THEO ANDRZEJEWSKI", "THEO"], "gender": "?", "first": 3, "spoke": 8}, {"id": 2, "name": "PASTRY CHEF MARGUERITE DUVALIER", "names": ["PASTRY CHEF MARGUERITE DUVALIER", "MARGUERITE"], "gender": "f", "first": 4, "spoke": 5}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. BAKERY TASTING ROOM - DAY", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "White tablecloths, little forks, six slices of cake on six small plates.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "A chandelier made of whisks.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "GABRIEL ROSSETTI-OKEKE, thirties, sits very straight beside his fiance THEO ANDRZEJEWSKI, thirties, who is already eating.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "Across from them, PASTRY CHEF MARGUERITE DUVALIER, fifties, stands with her hands folded, wearing the placid smile of someone who has seen every possible argument over frosting.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "He lifts his fork, takes a bite of the lemon, closes his eyes, and sets the fork down with great care, and he turns to the other man, and he whispers something that makes him laugh with his mouth full, and he waves a hand, spraying crumbs, and then he points the fork at the chef.", "para": 1, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "This is the one.", "name": "THEO", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "We haven't tried the others.", "name": "GABRIEL", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "We don't need to.", "name": "THEO", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Take your time. Some couples spend hours.", "name": "MARGUERITE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "We're not some couples.", "name": "GABRIEL", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "We have a flight at four.", "name": "THEO", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Of course.", "name": "MARGUERITE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "He pushes the plate aside, reaches for the vanilla, tastes it, and nods, and the other one nods back, and they look at each other, and each of them lifts a fork and feeds the other a bite of the third slice, solemn as a communion.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Oh.", "name": "GABRIEL", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Oh.", "name": "THEO", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That's the almond.", "name": "MARGUERITE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": ["beaming"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "We'll take the almond.", "name": "GABRIEL", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "And the lemon on the top tier.", "name": "THEO", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Lovely. I'll draw up the order.", "name": "MARGUERITE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "She disappears into the kitchen.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "The room is quiet.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "A clock ticks.", "para": 3, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "Theo slides his hand across the tablecloth and takes Gabriel's.", "para": 3, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Can I tell you something?", "name": "THEO", "speaker": 1, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Always.", "name": "GABRIEL", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I didn't want the cake.", "name": "THEO", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "What?", "name": "GABRIEL", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I wanted the excuse to sit here and watch you pick.", "name": "THEO", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "Gabriel stares at him.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "Then, with enormous dignity, he picks up the lemon slice and presses it into his own face.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "The kitchen door swings open.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "Marguerite stands there with a clipboard and takes it in without blinking.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Shall I note \"fruit-forward\"?", "name": "MARGUERITE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Please.", "name": "GABRIEL", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["through lemon"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}]}